 "title": "Filtered colimits of globally generated sheaves",
 "statement": "A filtered colimit of globally generated sheaves of abelian groups on\na site is globally generated.",
 "source": {
  "document": "literature/blueprint/master/blueprint/sec-smooth-purity/sk-prop-sf-kunneth-ordinary/lem-kun-colim-gbl-gen.md",
